dc:contributor  a  owl:AnnotationProperty .

:R-HSA-937061  a            obo:GO_0035666 , owl:NamedIndividual ;
        rdfs:comment        "TRIF(TICAM1) was shown to induce IRF3/7 and NFkappaB activation and apoptosis through distinct intracellular signaling pathways [Han KJ et al 2004; Kaiser WJ and Offermann MK et al 2005]. TRIF consists of an N-terminal region (1-234), a TIR domain (235-500), and a C-terminal region (501-680).<p> The N-terminal region of TRIF harbors TRAF (TNF receptor associated factor) family proteins and forms complexes containing IRF-3 and/or NFkB -activating kinases. The C-terminal region of TRIF can recruit receptor-interacting protein-1 (RIP-1), and this event is followed by the activation of IKK complex." ;
        rdfs:label          "TRIF(TICAM1)-mediated TLR4 signaling" ;
        dc:contributor      "GOC:reactome_curators" , "Reviewed: Gillespie, ME, 2010-11-30" , "Authored: Shamovsky, V, 2010-06-01" , "Reviewed: Fitzgerald, Katherine A, 2012-11-13" , "Edited: Shamovsky, V, 2010-11-15" ;
        dc:date             "2023-06-21" ;
        pav:providedBy      "https://reactome.org" ;
        oboInOwl:hasDbXref  "R-HSA-937061" ;
        skos:narrower       <http://model.geneontology.org/R-HSA-166166/R-HSA-166166> ;
        skos:note           "org.biopax.paxtools.model.level3.Pathway" .

